This permit requirement of this article shall not apply to:
(1) Funeral processions formed and conducted in accordance with O.C.G.A. § 40-6-76(a);
(2) A government entity or agency acting within the scope of its legal authority, duties and functions;
(4) Picketing involving less than 30 persons and no vehicles or floats, whose route is confined solely to public sidewalks and which does not obstruct or impair normal traffic movement (vehicles or pedestrians) in, along, or on any public street, or encroach on private property adjacent to the sidewalk unless written permission is first obtained from the property owner, and which does not involve sound amplification or noises regulated by the city's noise pollution regulations; or
